1
00:00:00,626 --> 00:00:03,256
♪ So hang your stockings
and say your prayers ♪

2
00:00:03,262 --> 00:00:06,192
(radio turns off)
♪ 'Cause Santa Claus
is coming tonight... ♪

3
00:00:07,400 --> 00:00:08,470
(Bernadette(singing):)Why'd you turn it off?

4
00:00:08,467 --> 00:00:11,507
(Sheldon:)Because in the last ten minutes,
Santa came to town,

5
00:00:11,504 --> 00:00:15,644
(Sheldon:)kissed Mommy and ran Grandma
over with a reindeer.

6
00:00:15,641 --> 00:00:17,711
(Sheldon:)I had a drunk uncle
who did all those things.

7
00:00:17,710 --> 00:00:20,110
(Sheldon:)Nobody sings songs about him.

8
00:00:20,112 --> 00:00:23,452
(Bernadette:)Maybe you'd like it more if you
thought of Santa as a superhero

9
00:00:23,449 --> 00:00:26,349
(Bernadette:)and his power is bringing joy
to children.

10
00:00:26,352 --> 00:00:29,052
(Sheldon:)My uncle was accused
of that, too.

11
00:00:29,055 --> 00:00:32,055
(Sheldon:)It turned out
to be legal in Oklahoma.

12
00:00:32,058 --> 00:00:34,058
(Bernadette:)Okay, new subject.

13
00:00:34,060 --> 00:00:35,790
(Bernadette:)Let's talk
about presents.

14
00:00:35,795 --> 00:00:37,495
(Bernadette:)What did you get Amy?

15
00:00:37,496 --> 00:00:39,296
(Sheldon:)Oh, we're not exchanging gifts.

16
00:00:39,298 --> 00:00:42,268
(Bernadette:)Come on, Sheldon, you
have to get her something.

17
00:00:43,636 --> 00:00:44,636
(Sheldon:)Why should I?

18
00:00:44,636 --> 00:00:45,636
(Sheldon:)She knows
that I don't like Christmas,

19
00:00:45,638 --> 00:00:48,438
(Sheldon:)and yet, every year,
she forces me to celebrate it.

20
00:00:48,441 --> 00:00:51,471
(Sheldon:)Not only am I going to this
foolish dinner against my will.

21
00:00:51,477 --> 00:00:54,107
(Sheldon:)At the Christmas tree lot,
there was mistletoe,

22
00:00:54,113 --> 00:00:56,443
(Sheldon:)and she kissed me
under it in public.

23
00:00:56,449 --> 00:01:00,019
(Sheldon:)Like we were the stars
of a Tijuana sex show.

